iki/%E6%B4%81%E8%A5%BF%E5%8D%A1\" title=\"洁西卡\"><img alt=\"洁西卡\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-305601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/48/HeadIconSmall-305601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%81%E8%A5%BF%E5%8D%A1\" title=\"洁西卡\">洁西卡</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305604</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/洁西卡技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/技能1.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/洁西卡.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/技能2.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/洁西卡大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3056/305604/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">这里并非荒芜之地。与此相反，这儿从不缺乏笑声、奏乐声与其他吵闹得像是一场庆典的动静。<br />尽管这里的笑声总是来自同一个嗓音。这个年轻的声音清了清喉咙：“在这个美好的时刻……哦不，等等。”<br />她整理了一下歪掉的藤编羽翼。毛茸茸的宾客们没有异议，被她随手搁置在树桩上的“新人们”也没有异议。仪式从头开始，奏乐、新人入场、负责祝福的天使清清嗓子：“在这个美好的时刻……”<br />这一次翅膀没有歪斜。宾客们叽叽喳喳地欢呼，抛出一簇簇的花瓣，有几位宾客冲上来，想要来到更近的地方祝贺新人。<br />“别挤！我们该开始下一段故事了，我想想……”她递出了左手的新人，放在一位毛茸茸宾客的嘴边，“在婚礼当晚，新郎被剖开了肚子……”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305604\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305607.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1b/Belonging-305607.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“见证与祝福”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"To Witness and to Bless\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />14.6<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一对藤蔓编织的翅膀，精致、柔韧。受访者认为，这是她作为“见证与祝福之人”应有的装饰品。<br />显然，这对翅膀没有赋予受访者飞翔的能力，但它具有的某种使命感，使受访者更加沉浸于她的“乐园”之中。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305608.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/51/Belonging-305608.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">一对新人<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Newlyweds</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一对正在接受祝福的恋人。<br />它们那无邪又柔弱的心呀，正在用芬芳诉说忠诚；它们那青涩又鲜嫩的面颊呀，正值美好又易逝的青春。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305609.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a8/Belonging-305609.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“邂逅”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Sweet Beginning\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条缎带与一枝嫩芽，末梢相触，但尚未缠绕成结。<br />据受访者描述，这象征着一次友好的相遇。“此时你可能有所预感……它将带来一连串的美好回忆。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B01.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 乐园之声1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B01.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B01.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B01.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B01.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B01.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B02.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 乐园之声2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B02.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B02.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B02.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B02.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B02.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B02.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">乐园之声 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Sound of Paradise</small></span></span>"}}